          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**imv** is a fast command-line image viewer for the iosc Wayland compositor.\n\nimv handles large image collections with quick navigation and keyboard control.\n\n- Native Wayland client, no X11 required\n- Handles common formats including PNG and JPEG\n- Pan, zoom, and slideshow with keyboard shortcuts\n- Scriptable through its command interface\n\nLaunch it inside an Xios desktop session running the iosc compositor."
